# Global Rules

<!--
  Template for your personal OpenCode/Claude global rules.

  Copy this file to `global/AGENTS.md` and fill in your details.
  `global/AGENTS.md` is gitignored so your real identity and preferences stay
  off the public repo. `make deploy-global` installs it to
  ~/.config/opencode/AGENTS.md (which ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md symlinks to).
-->

